{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.rinze.rain",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "站前突然下起雨",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.rinze.rain",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.rinze.rain",
    "idolId": "rinze",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "真头疼啊……突然下这么大。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "要暂时避雨吗……",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是啊……我也该带把折叠伞的。抱歉，凛世。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "凛世，不要紧的……",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "──阿嚏。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "凛世，和服都湿了不是吗！没注意到，抱歉！总之，先穿上这件外套。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "不……不能给制作人大人添麻烦。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "话不能这么说……没办法，我去趟便利店吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "凛世……真的，不要紧的……",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，我去买伞。记得附近应该有一家。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "不，您的心意就足够了……",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（可是……把湿着的凛世留在这儿也让人担心。）不过，也是啊……也许马上就停了，稍微等等看吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "是，就……那样吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……雨一直不停啊。好像比刚才更大了……",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "是……",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……嗯……沉默着也不是办法，找点话说吧。）",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "还是把外套借给你吧？",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "……总觉得，一个人都没有啊。",
            "nextNodeId": "110"
          },
          {
            "label": "希望早点放晴啊。",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "越来越冷了……不能让凛世感冒。",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "……制作人大人。凛世，也是同样的心情。",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶……？",
        "nextNodeId": "103"
      },
      "103": {
        "id": "103",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "凛世也，不想让制作人大人感冒……",
        "nextNodeId": "104"
      },
      "104": {
        "id": "104",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……这样啊。凛世也在担心我。）……谢谢你，凛世。",
        "nextNodeId": "105"
      },
      "105": {
        "id": "105",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "凛世，什么都没……",
        "nextNodeId": "106"
      },
      "106": {
        "id": "106",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，怎么说呢，因为凛世的话，身体也觉得暖和起来了。"
      },
      "110": {
        "id": "110",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "制作人大人……",
        "nextNodeId": "111"
      },
      "111": {
        "id": "111",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，不，没什么深意，只是这么安静，会想听听大家的声音啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "112"
      },
      "112": {
        "id": "112",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "是，可是……凛世和制作人大人，像是这世上只剩两个人……真好。",
        "nextNodeId": "113"
      },
      "113": {
        "id": "113",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？嘛……一个人的话会寂寞，两个人的话就不寂寞了。",
        "nextNodeId": "114"
      },
      "114": {
        "id": "114",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "是……",
        "nextNodeId": "115"
      },
      "115": {
        "id": "115",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈。好，难得的机会，再聊一会儿吧。"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "……制作人大人，是这样想的啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那是，我不想让凛世感冒啊。凛世不想放晴吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "如果制作人大人希望的话……可是……",
        "nextNodeId": "123"
      },
      "123": {
        "id": "123",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……凛世是喜欢雨吗？）总之，这样下去肯定要感冒。凛世，能再靠近一点吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "124"
      },
      "124": {
        "id": "124",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "……！可以，吗……",
        "nextNodeId": "125"
      },
      "125": {
        "id": "125",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……有、有点太近了……吧？稍微，保持点距离不好吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "126"
      },
      "126": {
        "id": "126",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "……给您添麻烦了吗……非常抱歉……"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
